    "final_answer": "## Task Result: Unable to Complete — Product Discontinued\n\nI was unable to retrieve a price for the **Apple iPhone 14 Plus (256GB, Purple)** because this product is **no longer available for sale on apple.com**.\n\n### What I Found\n\n1. **Direct buy page returns \"Page Not Found\"**: Navigating to `https://www.apple.com/shop/buy-iphone/iphone-14-plus` produces an Apple \"Page Not Found\" error (the page reads: *\"The page you're looking for can't be found.\"*).\n\n2. **Not in the current iPhone lineup**: The `/shop/buy-iphone` page lists only the current lineup — iPhone Duo, iPhone 18 Pro / 18 Pro Max, iPhone Air, iPhone 17, iPhone 17e, and iPhone 16. The iPhone 14 Plus is not among them.\n\n3. **Not in the Refurbished store**: The `/shop/refurbished/iphone` store only offers iPhone 15 series, iPhone 16 series, iPhone 16e, and iPhone 18 series. The iPhone 14 Plus is not available even refurbished.\n\n4. **Site search yields no buy page**: Searching apple.com for \"iPhone 14 Plus\" returns results only about newer iPhone models and a few support/battery test references — no live product listing with pricing.\n\n### Conclusion\n\nApple has **discontinued sales of the iPhone 14 Plus** through its online store. Because no product page exists for this SKU on apple.com, there is no current Apple-listed price for the 256GB Purple variant. To obtain a price, you would need to check third-party retailers (e.g., Amazon, Best Buy, carrier stores) or the used/refurbished market.",
